      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-348980",
      ":question/problem": "Lionel and David are youth soccer players. In the previous season, $12%$ of Lionel\u2019s goals were scored from the penalty spot, while the decimal proportion of David\u2019s goals scored from the penalty spot was $0.1.$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. Less than half of Lionel's goals scored were from the penalty spot.\n\nII. More than half of David's goals scored were from the penalty spot.\n\nIII. Lionel had a greater percentage of goals scored from the penalty spot compared to David."
