      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-350266",
      ":question/problem": "Sana and Talia are students. In the previous semester, the decimal proportion of Sana\u2019s homework assignments that were turned in early was $0.4,$ while $45%$ of Talia\u2019s homework assignments were turned in early. \n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nI. Less than half of Sana's homework assignments were turned in early.\n\nII. More than half of Talia's homework assignments were turned in early.\n\nIII. Sana had a greater percentage of homework assignments turned in early compared to Talia."
